{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/964e7b4cf206b38c9e2a6bb71f760946.avif?t=1768652440\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2014 Mesorift Survival \u2014</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mesorift Survival</strong> offers a classic survival experience with an exciting mix of PvP and PvE \u2013 set in a dangerous, tropical world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vast open-world map made up of three islands \u2013 one large main island and two smaller ones. You'll encounter dense jungle vegetation, abandoned bunker facilities, and old radio towers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Mesorift Survival</i> is launching in <strong>Early Access (version 0.0.1)</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This first public build lays the foundation\u2014content, balance, and performance will expand with frequent updates. Your feedback directly shapes development.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Survival Start</strong><br>You begin your journey on the beach \u2013 with nothing. Gather wood, stone, and other materials to craft your first tools like an axe and pickaxe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/d666fc590c463668fbd4bdeaeda48eee.poster.avif?t=1768652440\" width=500 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/d666fc590c463668fbd4bdeaeda48eee.webm?t=1768652440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/d666fc590c463668fbd4bdeaeda48eee.mp4?t=1768652440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dinosaurs</strong> <br>Due to a failed experiment, dinosaurs are now roaming the island \u2013 neither the bunker nor the radio tower facility was spared.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/aab3ae539475575ebeeae84c791e77a3.poster.avif?t=1768652440\" width=500 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/aab3ae539475575ebeeae84c791e77a3.webm?t=1768652440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/aab3ae539475575ebeeae84c791e77a3.mp4?t=1768652440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PvP and PvE Elements</strong><br>In addition to AI threats, other players can be just as deadly. Will you form alliances or trust no one?</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resources &amp; Exploration</strong><br>Venture deeper into the wilderness to discover valuable resources like oil, silver, copper, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/7147e45ad5dfc31deb2eb971d34743f0.poster.avif?t=1768652440\" width=500 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/7147e45ad5dfc31deb2eb971d34743f0.webm?t=1768652440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/7147e45ad5dfc31deb2eb971d34743f0.mp4?t=1768652440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Base Building &amp; Crafting</strong><br>Construct and upgrade your own base. Craft useful tools and powerful weapons to defend yourself and dominate the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/86ae0cf1be155c3194cddcac911ba2db.poster.avif?t=1768652440\" width=500 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/86ae0cf1be155c3194cddcac911ba2db.webm?t=1768652440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/86ae0cf1be155c3194cddcac911ba2db.mp4?t=1768652440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create Your Own Dedicated Server</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Server Settings</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player count, camera settings, max dino spawns, password, PvP or PvE mode, and more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/f29f9e96ce79fe39425f0dd03b3a0921.poster.avif?t=1768652440\" width=500 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/f29f9e96ce79fe39425f0dd03b3a0921.webm?t=1768652440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790650/extras/f29f9e96ce79fe39425f0dd03b3a0921.mp4?t=1768652440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether solo or with friends \u2013 <i>Mesorift Survival</i> challenges you to survive, explore, and conquer in a brutal, untamed world.</p>","achievements":{